            <p>A cruise to nowhere on a Royal Caribbean features modern vessels with an array of activities, dining, and entertainment. Royal Caribbean specializes in massive, multifaceted vessels that offer something for every age group. Passengers aren't bored for long, even when they don't visit ports. </p>

            <p>Royal Caribbean sailing cruise ships to nowhere feature pools, live shows, specialty restaurants, and ocean views. It turns the ship into a floating resort. With no port days, travelers can fully experience the amenities without feeling pressured. </p>

